  "I don't trust geographers. Everything is round to them.": "Ne vjerujem geografima. Sve im je okruglo.",
  "I greet you in the name of the people, the army and my mother.": "Pozdravljam te u ime naroda, vojske i moje mame.",
  "I have a new plan: lunch first, then everything else.": "Imam novi plan: prvo ručak, pa sve ostalo.",
  "I have declared today a holiday of cakes.": "Proglasio sam današnji dan praznikom kolača.",
  "I have my pride, {ti}. A little, but I have it.": "Imam ja ponos, {ti}. Malo, ali imam.",
