  "The world": "Svijet",
  "The world after Napoleon: Britain, Russia, the Ottomans, Qing China, the young American republics. Musketeers, cavalry, cannons and Congreve rockets.": "Svijet poslije Napoleona: Britanija, Rusija, Osmanlije, Kina dinastije Ćing, mlade američke republike. Mušketari, konjica, topovi i Kongreveove rakete.",
  "The world around 1400: the Timurids, Ming China, the Mamluks, the Ottomans, European kingdoms, the Aztecs and the Inca. Knights, archers, trebuchets and the first bombards.": "Svijet oko 1400: Timuridi, Ming Kina, Mameluci, Osmanlije, evropska kraljevstva, Asteci i Inke. Vitezovi, strijelci, trebušei i prve bombarde.",
  "The world around the year 100: Rome, Parthia, China's Han dynasty, the Kushans and the tribes around them. Legions, cavalry, archers and siege engines — no gunpowder, planes or bombs.": "Svijet oko 100. godine: Rim, Partija, kineska dinastija Han, Kušani i plemena oko njih. Legije, konjica, strijelci i opsadne sprave — bez baruta, aviona i bombi.",
  "The world has calmed down: the coalition against you breaks up.": "Svijet se smirio: koalicija protiv tebe se raspada.",
  "The world in 1914: the colonial empires of Britain, France and Germany, the Russian and Ottoman empires, the USA, Japan, China… Trenches, heavy artillery, the first tanks and zeppelins.": "Svijet 1914: kolonijalna carstva Britanije, Francuske i Njemačke, Rusko i Osmansko carstvo, SAD, Japan, Kina… Rovovi, teška artiljerija, prvi tenkovi i cepelini.",
  "The world on the eve of war: Germany, the USSR, Japan, the USA, the British and French empires… Tanks, planes and paratroopers, V-2 rockets — and the atomic bomb only from minute 10.": "Svijet uoči rata: Njemačka, SSSR, Japan, SAD, Britansko i Francusko carstvo… Tenkovi, avioni i padobranci, V-2 rakete — a atomska bomba stiže tek od 10. minute.",
